@using KBN.Models;
@model List<SubscriberTableModal>
@Html.Hidden("resultCount", (int)ViewBag.totalEntries)
<style>
    table {
        border-collapse: separate !important;
        border-spacing: 0 5px !important;
    }

    th,
    td {
        padding: 5px;
        vertical-align: top !important;
    }

   
</style>
@if (Model != null)
{
    <div class="row row-sm">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
            <div class="">
                <div class="card-header row p-2 mx-0 bg-facebook-gradient rounded-3 text-black">
                    <div class="col-sm-8 d-flex flex-sm-row flex-column align-items-center justify-content-sm-between">
                        <h3 class="card-title"></h3>
                        <div id="paginate"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm d-flex flex-row align-items-center justify-content-sm-end justify-content-center">
                        <div class="">
                            <select id="pageSize" name="pagesize" class="form-control">
                                <option value="10">10</option>
                                <option value="20">20</option>
                                <option value="50">50</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="table-responsive overflow-auto" style="max-height:440px;">
                        <table class="table table-striped Smart-table  overflow-auto" id="dTable">
                            <thead class="bg-primary-transparent" style="border-top: 1px solid #efefef;">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="py-2 fw-bold ">UserName</th>
                                    <th class="py-2 fw-bold ">Password</th>
                                    <th class="py-2 fw-bold ">Customer Name</th>
                                    <th class="py-2 fw-bold ">Created By</th>
                                    <th class="py-2 fw-bold ">Created At</th>
                                    <th class="py-2 fw-bold ">Actions</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                @foreach (var item in @Model)
                                {
                                    <tr class="bg-light shadow-sm">
                                        <td class="py-2 rounded-start">
                                            @item.username
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-2">
                                            @{
                                                var decryptedPassword = AesEncryption.Decrypt(item.password_hash);
                                            }

                                            <span class="password-text" data-password="@decryptedPassword">••••••••</span>
                                            <i class="bi bi-eye ms-2 toggle-password" style="cursor:pointer;"></i>
                                        </td>


                                        @if (@item.customer_name != null)
                                        {
                                            <td>@item.customer_name</td>
                                        }
                                        else
                                        {
                                            <td>-</td>
                                        }

                                        <td class="py-2">
                                            @item.recorded_by
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-2">
                                            @item.recorded_at
                                        </td>
                                        <td>
                                            <i class="bi bi-trash delete" data-id="@item.id"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-pencil update" data-id="@item.id"></i>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                }

                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

<script>
    $(document).ready(function () {
        $("#pageSize").val('@ViewBag.PageSize');
    })
</script>
